Dynamic call t.Rollback() in ReadOnly: memTx.Rollback returns repo.ErrTxDone; fileTx.Rollback filters release()'s
errors with errors.Is(fs.ErrNotExist) || errors.Is(repo.ErrTxDone).
Expect repo.ErrTxDone only via the memTx Candidate (path through memTx.finish, not fileTx.release), and os.Remove's
errors (*fs.PathError) via fileTx, not-exist ones removed or marked possibly handled.
